### Operacion 1 - Consultar caso existente (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rescue-cases/RES-2026-100

### Operacion 2  - Consultar animal existente (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animals/AN-2026-100

### Operacion 3 - Registrar tratamiento (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/treatments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalCode": "AN-2026-100",
  "specialistCode": "SPEC-001",
  "performedAt": "2026-08-21T09:00:00",
  "type": "WOUND_CARE",
  "description": "Cleaning of left front flipper injury."
}

### Operacion 4  - Cambiar status a READY_FOR_RELEASE (200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rescue-cases/RES-2026-100/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "READY_FOR_RELEASE"
}

### Operacion 5 - Enviar status null (400 Bad Request)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rescue-cases/RES-2026-100/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": null
}

### Operacion 6  - Transición inválida (409 Conflict)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rescue-cases/RES-2026-100/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ADMITTED"
}

### Operacion 7  - Consultar animal inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animals/AN-999
 `409 Conflict` o `404 Not Found`) y el cuerpo JSON respectivo[cite: 46, 47, 48].